# Frontend

- Functional components + TypeScript; routing in `frontend/src/App.tsx` (react-router-dom).
- HTTP calls via `frontend/src/api/` (`client.ts`, `authApi.ts`; add `*Api.ts` modules as features return).
- Tests for API modules: [docs/reference/testing.md](mdc:docs/reference/testing.md).
- Formatting helpers: `frontend/src/utils/format.ts` when displaying numbers.
- Styles: existing classes in `App.css` / `index.css` — match the current UI layout.
- Routes and API mapping: [docs/reference/frontend.md](mdc:docs/reference/frontend.md) — add a row when adding pages or client functions.
